            "review_title": "Review at Raw",
            "review_text": "Bryan H\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam62 contributions\n0\nGreat spot for wine lovers!\nJul 2024 • Couples\nThis is a great place to relax and unwind, with attentive service, great offerings of both French and new world wines, and incredible dining options. In the short time we've been in HCMC, we've now visited Raw twice. Our first visit was to enjoy a nice dinner with apps and entrees over a bottle of wine. After learning of a their \"Wednesday Wine Night\", we went back to following week to enjoy a great selection of wines from Spain, Argentina, Chile, Australia and France, complimented by a variety of canapes to enjoy... for under $25 (USD) per person, hosted upstairs above the dining room. So, whether you're looking for a quiet evening to enjoy a romantic dinner, or looking to mix it up over wine and cocktails, while enjoying a mixture of R&B and jazz in the background, Raw is a place definitely worth taking in.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 12, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
